  "wiki": {
    "extract": "James Matthew Gallagher is an American politician who is a member of the United States House of Representatives from California's 1st congressional district. A member of the Republican Party, he served in the California State Assembly from 2014 to 2026, representing the 3rd district located in the northern Sacramento Valley.",
